<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Articles of Organization — {{ llc_name }}</title>
<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Oswald";
    src: url("./assets/fonts/Oswald-Regular.ttf") format("truetype");
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Oswald";
    src: url("./assets/fonts/Oswald-SemiBold.ttf") format("truetype");
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Roboto";
    src: url("./assets/fonts/Roboto-Regular.ttf") format("truetype");
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Roboto";
    src: url("./assets/fonts/Roboto-Bold.ttf") format("truetype");
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "DM Mono";
    src: url("./assets/fonts/DMMono-Regular.ttf") format("truetype");
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "DM Mono";
    src: url("./assets/fonts/DMMono-Medium.ttf") format("truetype");
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  @page {
    size: 210mm 297mm;
    margin: 25mm 20mm 20mm 20mm;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    color: #113A57;
    margin: 0;
  }

  p {
    orphans: 3;
    widows: 3;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .doc-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .doc-header .seal {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .doc-header h1 {
    font-family: "Oswald", sans-serif;
    font-size: 16pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: #113A57;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
  }

  .doc-header .subheading {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-size: 10pt;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #0087D4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .article {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  h2.article-heading {
    font-family: "Oswald", sans-serif;
    font-size: 13pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: #113A57;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #0087D4;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    break-after: avoid;
  }

  .two-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .two-col .col {
    width: 48%;
  }

  .label {
    font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 8pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    color: #0087D4;
    margin: 0 0 2px 0;
  }

  .statutory {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  table.authorized-persons {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  table.authorized-persons col.col-title {
    width: 15%;
  }

  table.authorized-persons col.col-name {
    width: 35%;
  }

  table.authorized-persons col.col-address {
    width: 50%;
  }

  table.authorized-persons thead th {
    font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 8pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    background: #113A57;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  table.authorized-persons tbody td {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-size: 10pt;
    color: #113A57;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(17, 58, 87, 0.15);
    padding: 6px 8px;
  }

  .table-key {
    font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 8pt;
    color: #113A57;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .attachment-notice {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #0087D4;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .provisions-block {
    background: rgba(0, 135, 212, 0.06);
    border-left: 3px solid #0087D4;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .muted {
    color: rgba(17, 58, 87, 0.55);
  }

  .signature-block {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(17, 58, 87, 0.3);
    padding-top: 12px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .signature-label {
    font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 8pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    color: #113A57;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
  }

  .zs-anchor {
    font-size: 4pt;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01);
  }

  .continuation {
    page-break-before: always;
  }

  .continuation .subheading {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-size: 10pt;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #0087D4;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="doc-header">
  <img src="./assets/florida_seal.png" alt="Florida Department of State Seal" class="seal">
  <h1>Articles of Organization for Florida Limited Liability Company</h1>
  <p class="subheading">Pursuant to Chapter 605, Florida Statutes</p>
</header>

<section class="article" id="article-i">
  <h2 class="article-heading">Article I — Name</h2>
  <!-- llc_name must contain LLC, L.L.C., or Limited Liability Company — enforced at intake, not here. -->
  <p>The name of the Limited Liability Company is: {{ llc_name }}</p>
</section>

<section class="article" id="article-ii">
  <h2 class="article-heading">Article II — Address</h2>
  <div class="two-col">
    <div class="col">
      <p class="label">Principal Office Address</p>
      <p>{{ principal_address }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col">
      <p class="label">Mailing Address</p>
      <p>{{ mailing_address }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="article" id="article-iii">
  <h2 class="article-heading">Article III — Registered Agent</h2>
  <p>{{ registered_agent_name }}</p>
  <p>{{ registered_agent_florida_address }}</p>
  <p class="statutory">Having been named as registered agent and to accept service of process for the above stated limited liability company at the place designated in this certificate, I hereby accept the appointment as registered agent and agree to act in this capacity. I further agree to comply with the provisions of all statutes relating to the proper and complete performance of my duties, and I am familiar with and accept the obligations of my position as registered agent as provided for in Chapter 605, F.S.</p>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <p class="signature-label">Registered Agent's Signature (REQUIRED)</p>
    {# Zoho Sign text-tag anchors must render as literal braces in the output HTML for Zoho Sign's text scanner — not resolved as Jinja variables #}
    <span class="zs-anchor">{{ '{{zs_agent_signature}}' }}</span>
    <span class="zs-anchor">{{ '{{zs_agent_printed_name}}' }}</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="article" id="article-iv">
  <h2 class="article-heading">Article IV — Authorized Persons</h2>
  <table class="authorized-persons">
    <colgroup>
      <col class="col-title">
      <col class="col-name">
      <col class="col-address">
    </colgroup>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Title</th>
        <th>Name</th>
        <th>Address</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for person in authorized_persons[:4] %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ person.article_iv_title }}</td>
        <td>{{ person.name }}</td>
        <td>{{ person.address }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      {% if authorized_persons|length < 4 %}
        {% for i in range(4 - authorized_persons|length) %}
        <tr>
          <td>&nbsp;</td>
          <td>&nbsp;</td>
          <td>&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="table-key">"AMBR" = Authorized Member | "MGR" = Manager</p>
  {% if authorized_persons|length > 4 %}
  <p class="attachment-notice">Additional authorized persons are listed on the attached continuation page. See Article IV — Continued (Attachment).</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{% if authorized_persons|length > 4 %}
<section class="article continuation" id="article-iv-continued">
  <h2 class="article-heading">Article IV — Continued (Attachment)</h2>
  <p class="subheading">Continuation of Article IV for {{ llc_name }}</p>
  <table class="authorized-persons">
    <colgroup>
      <col class="col-title">
      <col class="col-name">
      <col class="col-address">
    </colgroup>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Title</th>
        <th>Name</th>
        <th>Address</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for person in authorized_persons[4:] %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ person.article_iv_title }}</td>
        <td>{{ person.name }}</td>
        <td>{{ person.address }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="article" id="article-v">
  <h2 class="article-heading">Article V — Effective Date</h2>
  {% if effective_date_option == "Immediate" %}
  <p>The Limited Liability Company's existence shall be effective upon the date of filing.</p>
  {% elif effective_date_option in ("Future", "Backdated") %}
  <p>Effective date: {{ effective_date }}</p>
  <p>Your first Annual Report will be due by {{ annual_report_due_date }}.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="article" id="article-vi">
  <h2 class="article-heading">Article VI — Other Provisions</h2>
  {% if other_provisions %}
  <div class="provisions-block">
    <p>{{ other_provisions }}</p>
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="muted">No other provisions.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="article" id="required-signature">
  <h2 class="article-heading">Signature</h2>
  <p class="statutory">This document is executed in accordance with section 605.0203(1)(b), Florida Statutes. I am aware that any false information submitted in a document to the Department of State constitutes a third degree felony as provided for in s.817.155, F.S.</p>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <p class="signature-label">Signature of Authorized Person / Authorized Representative</p>
    {# Zoho Sign text-tag anchors must render as literal braces in the output HTML for Zoho Sign's text scanner — not resolved as Jinja variables #}
    <span class="zs-anchor">{{ '{{zs_authorized_signature}}' }}</span>
    <span class="zs-anchor">{{ '{{zs_authorized_printed_name}}' }}</span>
    <span class="zs-anchor">{{ '{{zs_date_signed}}' }}</span>
  </div>
</section>

</body>
</html>
